# Do not broadly ignore *.md or /references/:
# README.md, SKILL.md and references/*.md are PUBLIC RUNTIME SOURCES.
# assets/ is restricted to non-confidential fixtures and configuration.

# Generated or unreviewed image assets are private by default.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.tiff
*.tif
*.bmp
*.svg

# Experiment tables are private by default; allow only the bundled synthetic demo.
*.csv
!research-figure/assets/demo-synthetic-ablation.csv

# Same sensitive directories inside the installable Skill folder.
**/docs/
**/internal/
**/private/
**/notes/
**/drafts/
**/work/
**/runs/
**/output/
**/outputs/
**/artifacts/
**/generated/
**/checkpoints/
**/screenshots/

# Reproducible offline CI peer checkout is runtime-only
/_peer/